[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 243.99, "timestamp": "00:04:03", "text": "是的，我就是疤。你又是谁？残忍的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 246.0, "timestamp": "00:04:06", "text": "以及一个变态疯子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 249.429, "timestamp": "00:04:09", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 252.149, "timestamp": "00:04:12", "text": "Yan在哪儿？我们理应享有一次免费的会议。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 257.03, "timestamp": "00:04:17", "text": "此类干扰。你同意吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 259.509, "timestamp": "00:04:19", "text": "那个女孩，她会影响你的决定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 261.59, "timestamp": "00:04:21", "text": "判断。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 266.629, "timestamp": "00:04:26", "text": "回到我身边。喂。啊。所以你真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 269.99, "timestamp": "00:04:29", "text": "你关心她吗？不用担心。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 272.71, "timestamp": "00:04:32", "text": "我还没打算让你恨我。她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 275.67, "timestamp": "00:04:35", "text": "现在安全了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 278.07, "timestamp": "00:04:38", "text": "好，我们就好好享受在一起的时光吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 280.55, "timestamp": "00:04:40", "text": "目前是这样。别想那件事了。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 283.43, "timestamp": "00:04:43", "text": "考了B？是的，我做了。我拥有你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 290.87, "timestamp": "00:04:50", "text": "首先。我听说你丢了你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 292.79, "timestamp": "00:04:52", "text": "回忆。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 299.83, "timestamp": "00:04:59", "text": "没错，是真的。"}]